EN:
The snow kind of looks like sugar.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}As soon as you stop looking at me,
I'm gonna eat some, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
¡La nieve parece azúcar!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:001A:}}En cuanto
te vayas, creo que tomaré {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0005:0013:0000}} con azúcar.

IT:
La neve mi sembra zucchero filato!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Più la guardo e più mi viene
fame, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
Kar biraz şekere benziyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Sen arkanı döner dönmez biraz
tadına bakacağım, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Ehilà{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Con tutta questa neve, {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
sembra un pandoro ricoperto
di zucchero a velo!
